(re-record changes the digest: take it from skill-scripts-office/MANIFEST.json's sha256).

## 5. Callers of run_native
`shipped::run_native` now takes `P: WriteProof` (the office scripts write files); `Unlaned`, the only caller (skill-run's run.rs), satisfies it. Nothing to change.
